Problem 7
✏️ Steps / Flow
Create an empty map.
Go through each element in the list.
If the element already exists in the map, increase its count.
Otherwise, add the element with a count of 1.
Return the map.

START

Input nums

Create empty map frequency

FOR each element in nums
    IF element exists in frequency THEN
        frequency[element] = frequency[element] + 1
    ELSE
        frequency[element] = 1
    END IF
END FOR

Return frequency

STOP
